<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange on Friday said United Auto Group Inc was unavailable for after-hours trading because of news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Corimon SACA, Edison Brothers Stores Inc and Grupo Sidek SA.</p>
</text>
